==Notes==
*This armor is labeled [[Marhan's Grotto]] [[Marhan's Grotto armor#Marhan's Grotto Elite Armor|Elite Armor]] in the [["Resilience"]] monument in the [[Hall of Monuments]].
*Any [[dye]] applied onto the female hose (leg piece) is somewhat redundant as it gets obscured by the attire (chest piece).
*The male leggings may sometimes clip through the coat during some emotes such as /guitar.
*The male leggings clip through the boots when sitting.

